"下 :guilabel:`套用`。若要移除連結，請按一下 :icon:`fa-unlink` (:guilabel:`移"
"除連結`)。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/essentials/html_editor.rst:291
msgid ""
":icon:`fa-file-image-o` (:guilabel:`Replace`): Replace the image by "
"searching the :doc:`Unsplash </applications/general/integrations/unsplash>` "
"database, adding a URL, or uploading a different one."
msgstr ""
":icon:`fa-file-image-o` (:guilabel:`替換`)：透過搜尋 :doc:`Unsplash </"
"applications/general/integrations/unsplash>` 資料庫、新增 URL 或上傳其他圖片"
"來替換圖片。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/essentials/html_editor.rst:294
msgid ":icon:`fa-trash` (:guilabel:`Delete`): Delete the image."
msgstr ":icon:`fa-trash` (:guilabel:`刪除`)：刪除圖片。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/essentials/html_editor.rst:297
