"項，即可依產品類別進行篩選。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/essentials/product_catalog.rst:88
msgid "The filter sidebar in the product catalog."
msgstr "產品目錄中的篩選側邊欄。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/essentials/product_catalog.rst:92
msgid "Add or remove a product from a record form"
msgstr "從記錄表單新增或移除產品"

#: ../../export/content/applications/essentials/product_catalog.rst:94
msgid ""
"This example uses a sales quotation. The UI may differ from what is pictured "
"depending on the apps and modules active on the Odoo database."
msgstr ""
"本範例使用銷售報價單。使用者介面可能會因 Odoo 資料庫中啟用的應用程式和模組而"
"與圖示有所不同。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/essentials/product_catalog.rst:97
msgid ""
"To add a product to a form, click on the product's card or the :icon:`fa-"
"shopping-cart` :guilabel:`Add` button in the bottom corner of the card. "
"Doing so adds one unit of the product, which is displayed in a field in the "
"bottom corner of the card."
msgstr ""
"若要將產品新增至表單，請按一下該產品的卡片，或卡片底角的\\ :icon:`fa-"
"shopping-cart` :guilabel:`新增`\\ 按鈕。這樣做會新增一件該產品，數量會顯示在"
"卡片底角的欄位中。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/essentials/product_catalog.rst:101
msgid ""
"To adjust the quantity of the product added, click the :icon:`fa-"
"minus` :guilabel:`(minus)` and :icon:`fa-plus` :guilabel:`(plus)` buttons to "
"adjust the quantity by one. Alternatively, a specific quantity can be "
"entered by typing it in manually. Clicking the product card additional times "
"also increases the product count with each click."
msgstr ""
"若要調整已新增產品的數量，請按一下\\ :icon:`fa-minus` :guilabel:`（減號）`\\ "
"與\\ :icon:`fa-plus` :guilabel:`（加號）`\\ 按鈕，每次將數量調整 1。或者，也"
"可以手動輸入特定數量。每次多按一下產品卡片，產品數量也會隨之增加。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/essentials/product_catalog.rst:106
msgid ""
"To remove a product from the order, either click the :icon:`fa-"
"trash` :guilabel:`Remove` button in the bottom corner of the product card or "
"click the :icon:`fa-minus` :guilabel:`(minus)` button until the quantity is "
"zero."
msgstr ""
"若要從訂單中移除產品，可以按一下產品卡片底角的\\ :icon:`fa-trash` :guilabel:`"
"移除`\\ 按鈕，或是按一下\\ :icon:`fa-minus` :guilabel:`（減號）`\\ 按鈕，直到"
"數量歸零為止。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/essentials/product_catalog.rst:110
msgid ""
"Once the desired quantity of each product has been reached, return to the "
"form by clicking the :guilabel:`Back to [X]` button at the top of the "
"screen. This button differs depending on the type of form being configured "
"(quotation, |BoM|, etc.)."
msgstr ""
"達到每項產品的所需數量後，請按一下畫面頂部的\\ :guilabel:`返回 [X]`\\ 按鈕以"
"返回表單。此按鈕會根據所設定的表單類型（報價單、\\ |BoM|\\ 等）而有所不同。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/essentials/product_catalog.rst:115
msgid ""
"Products appear in the product catalog and can be added to orders even if "
"there are zero units of the product on hand. As a result, it is important to "
"confirm the quantity of a product being added to an order is actually "
"available."
msgstr ""
"即使產品的在庫數量為零，產品仍會顯示在產品目錄中，並可新增至訂單。因此，請務"
"必確認新增至訂單的產品數量確實有庫存。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/essentials/product_catalog.rst:120
msgid "Products with packaging options"
msgstr "具有包裝選項的產品"

#: ../../export/content/applications/essentials/product_catalog.rst:122
msgid ""
"For products with multiple packaging options, a drop-down menu appears when "
"that product is selected. Choosing a packaging option other than the default "
"displays both the cost for that package and the per-unit cost for the items "
"within it."
msgstr ""
"對於具有多個包裝選項的產品，在選取該產品時會顯示下拉式選單。若選擇預設以外的"
"包裝選項，則會同時顯示該包裝的費用以及其中項目的每單位費用。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/essentials/product_catalog.rst:126
msgid ""
"A product card with the packaging drop-down expanded and showing per-unit "
"pricing."
msgstr "展開包裝下拉式選單並顯示每單位定價的產品卡片。"

